  "route": "original",
  "notes": "Backlog game, picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year (docs/PLAN.md section 2 ordering). StrategyWiki has no page under \"LEGO Batman: Legacy of the Dark Knight\" or \"Lego Batman: Legacy of the Dark Knight\". lego.fandom.com (Brickipedia) has a page \"LEGO Batman: Legacy of the Dark Knight\" with about 157 links, including subpages Prologue and Chapter 1 to 6, \"Mayhem Mode\", \"Escape Arkham\", \"Crew Hire\" and \"Mayhem Prep\"; names only were looked at, nothing copied. Steam has achievements for the Prologue and Chapters One to Five plus \"Complete Story Mode\", while Fandom lists a Chapter 6, so the last chapter may have no achievement of its own. None of the 64 Steam achievements is hidden. Achievements 53 to 64 (Arkham breakout, Mayhem Runs, crew, hideout, Joker-Mite shop, Villy Awards) form one block; they were put in a Mayhem Mode chapter, named after the Fandom subpage. \"Rebuilding Gotham\" (cash in a Challenge in the Batcave) sits with side activities. The \"Complete Bruce's Gray Ghost costume\" achievement (95.6%) sits in heroes and suits."
